#created by Duel Circuit - Gouki / Warrior Link (2018)
#era 2018
#tier Tier 1 / premier combo
#about Gouki monsters replaced themselves through Graveyard searches and fueled Link climbing, Extra Link boards, and at times hand-disruption routes.
#why Eight of the Top 32 at Niagara Falls played Gouki; the runner-up used it. Its oppressive end boards helped define early Link-era design problems.
#source Format Library deck 67255 (https://www.formatlibrary.com/decks/67255): Gouki, 9th at YCSNIA18 (Danger 1 format, 2018-10-20)
